7-28T14:19:55Z", "repo": "OMDb_Lookup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c55876ad619d3d6cd70a4250c5e71cec5eaded25", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-07-28T14:14:40Z", "repo": "OMDb_Lookup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "982fb99b13640f01d8aa56bb559b39ad69e83391", "message": "Added source code", "created_at": "2023-07-28T13:56:26Z", "repo": "OMDb_Lookup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7459af64c69a158229f94baa79cebd1be1165ae5", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-07-28T13:55:54Z", "repo": "OMDb_Lookup", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3f23b7d79497e85dc273c062166c8dd0f3981758", "message": "add env var `ICON_DIR` to wrap binary w/ favicon\n\nDefaults to assuming the icon is in the current directory while allowing\nusers to override based on their installation preference. A more\n\u201cpythonic\u201d approach may make sense in the future if I figure out\n`package-data`", "created_at": "2025-08-12T00:15:19Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2aab99b121e66fc735c8bfb51cc0d73169933ab0", "message": "nix: cp `favicon.png` -> `$out/docs/img` via `postInstall`\n\nShould fix runtime error caused by this file being missing for nix-users", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:16:42Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b5b73b2103f8964920cdb9330ffae788ef6b40f0", "message": "readme: add div back to overview and increase logo w -> 300", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:42:36Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "560f0a8bbed43874756bece404fd65337339eb3b", "message": "readme: revert overview restructure in favor of header br after badges", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:40:50Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49e171e16f3faadb99f9733e9848fa5abcc30479", "message": "set favicon for gradio app", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:35:18Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "321ebdf9f479803ead84ec6c40bd9f2613895a18", "message": "readme: restructure overview and tick 'Add type annotations...'", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:30:13Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "45987173b7afb90bc0e312fe775b0bcf5564265c", "message": "nix: rm gradio override from `overlay.nix` and add aarch64-linux support\n\nThe workaround for setting `share = True` no longer seems to be\nnecessary. This should drastically reduce build times and might make it\npossible to add darwin to ci", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:13:03Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "70dd2308411a27abea0397ea379e4e28f0aa9df6", "message": "ci: add `aarch64-darwin` to ci builds", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:02:35Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b08a37fe9362d91fe42978f4098b101ff4bb49fc", "message": "nix: set `dontCheckRuntimeDeps` -> true and rm disabled gradio tests from overlay\n\nI specify exact dependency versions in `pyrproject.toml` so that `pip\ninstall .` just works for non-nix users, but this prevents nix users\nfrom installing system-wide while avoiding nixpkgs duplications via\n`inputs.nixpkgs.follows = \"nixpkgs\";` since updated nixpkgs deps won't\nmatch the versions specified in `pyrproject.toml`. Enabling this setting\ndisables this check to allow for the best of both worlds IMO\n\nAlso removed the disabled gradio tests from the overlay since it seems\nunnecessary now", "created_at": "2025-08-08T21:23:54Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ea7f1be8eeb4f18c110e8ac2322814ce14f0f5b", "message": "chore: set upright -> strict and implement quick wins\n\nFurther work may increase confidence in some key types (like rag_chain,\nOPTIONS). Also removed Darwin from build targets since it was eating my\nCI minutes", "created_at": "2025-08-07T21:47:20Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e32431ff042ba926563572d0ebd5293e9e6c292", "message": "nix: modularize shell + package and mv scripts -> `script/`\n\n- Also removed `aarch64-linux` support\u2013can be added back once another\nlinux-share link is added", "created_at": "2025-07-31T21:47:41Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d09ae8102b1a6018c11b33622a55a532e2ae4501", "message": "chore: rm date from SPDX and mv it to top of file on `*.py`", "created_at": "2025-07-30T22:21:33Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "75abd9aa3186d7770c8ef0931c17da8a8990fb96", "message": "ci: add `garnix.yaml` to support aarch64", "created_at": "2025-07-30T22:16:35Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fcb416f4e0c63ca35227524e0c31a6afab4510b5", "message": "update: bump nixpkgs and migrate to python 13 w/ fixes\n\nFixes\n- rp `\u201dgradio/monochrome\u201d` -> `gr.themes.Monochrome()` w/ `GoogleFont`\n- Add option to force dark theme by default via js, since it seems as\nthough the light variant of monochrome no longer exists\n- rp `prettier-plugin-toml` -> `tuple`", "created_at": "2025-07-30T21:49:20Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "70f4a331a7b0d036ac61ff80b34140ff166f5682", "message": "chore: customize devShell prompt", "created_at": "2025-01-19T19:01:24Z", "repo": "chat-script", "file_sampled": f